{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a forgotten laboratory, a plant awakens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spring Escape</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0thrilling 2D platformer about a flower and a piece of dirt, <strong>Patchy and Tulip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in the depths of a destroyed laboratory, this duo sets out to find a way to the surface, a journey where they'll have to prove to be true heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1769192363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras_big/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1769192363 width=800 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road ahead is filled with obstacles, enemies, challenges, and sorta-helpful allies, will these two find a way out while discovering the truth behind this place, the world outside and themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Escape aims to be a <strong>simple, yet packed and extremely enjoyable game</strong>, not breaking new grounds but providing a constant quality and fun experience. With a linear yet compelling story, an exciting campaign and lots of side and post-game content that will have you replay the game in wildly different ways and face brand new threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1769192363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras_big/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1769192363 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any great platformer worth its name, Spring Escape features a cast of creative and wholly unique bosses, these giants creatures are a major highlight of the game. And don't think they'll stop giving problems past the credits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906210?t=1769192363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769192363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769192363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769192363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3151470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of a forgotten laboratory, a plant awakens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spring Escape</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0thrilling 2D platformer about a flower and a piece of dirt, <strong>Patchy and Tulip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in the depths of a destroyed laboratory, this duo sets out to find a way to the surface, a journey where they'll have to prove to be true heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1769192363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras_big/14d94ba00f6882bc691f0eef18997033.avif?t=1769192363 width=800 height=688 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road ahead is filled with obstacles, enemies, challenges, and sorta-helpful allies, will these two find a way out while discovering the truth behind this place, the world outside and themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Escape aims to be a <strong>simple, yet packed and extremely enjoyable game</strong>, not breaking new grounds but providing a constant quality and fun experience. With a linear yet compelling story, an exciting campaign and lots of side and post-game content that will have you replay the game in wildly different ways and face brand new threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1769192363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/extras_big/84bee755f22abd05e5e3d1555bc74bd8.avif?t=1769192363 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any great platformer worth its name, Spring Escape features a cast of creative and wholly unique bosses, these giants creatures are a major highlight of the game. And don't think they'll stop giving problems past the credits.</p>","developers":["ELE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906210/header.jpg?t=17691